%% APNs code-identity attestation as built at 5d400cf75. Source of truth for
%% apns-code-identity.svg and .png; re-render after editing:
%%   mmdc -i apns-code-identity.mmd -o apns-code-identity.svg
%%   mmdc -i apns-code-identity.mmd -o apns-code-identity.png -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Provider (signed app, GUI session)
    participant K as Coordinator
    participant A as Apple APNs

    P->>K: register {apns_device_token, apns_environment, public_key K}
    Note over K: codeAttestLoop: cached proof within reuseWindow (2h)<br/>for the same device → resume challenge instead of a push
    alt push budget available
        K->>K: budget check (maxAttempts=3, retrySpacing 5 min ± 20 s jitter,<br/>backgroundPushCooldown 48 min, alertPushCooldown 5h)
        K->>A: push {nonce Box-sealed to K, provider_id, coordinator_id}<br/>apns-push-type background · apns-priority 5 · JWT ES256 (50 min)
        A->>P: delivery to the App Store / Developer ID signed bundle
        P->>K: code_attestation_response {code_challenge, signature}<br/>signed by the Secure Enclave key
    else resume challenge (cached proof)
        K->>P: code_attestation_resume_challenge {code_challenge, nonce}
        P->>K: code_attestation_response (resumeTimeout 30 s)
    end
    Note over K: handleCodeAttestationResponse → GrantProcessCodeAttested<br/>requires same K and same APNs token as at challenge time
    K->>P: trust_status {code_attested: true}
    Note over K: challengeValidity 30 min · budgetClearCooldown 45 min<br/>enforcement: EIGENINFERENCE_CODE_ATTESTATION_ENFORCE_AFTER or provider version ≥ 0.8.15
